# ==============================================================================
# Mai Hu Kabadiwala — environment files live next to each app:
#
#   apps/backend/.env          backend (free AI keys, database path, CORS)
#                              → copy apps/backend/.env.example
#   apps/collector-mobile/.env mobile app (backend URL, default language/map centre)
#                              → copy apps/collector-mobile/.env.example
#
# The web portals (apps/recycler-web, apps/admin-web) need no configuration;
# they talk to the backend at http://localhost:8000.
#
# The backend also reads this root file as a fallback, so leave it empty unless
# you deliberately want a value to apply there.
# ==============================================================================
